{title: Tera Mera Rishta Purana}
{artist: Mustafa Zahid}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]Tera Yakeen Kyun,        [D]Maine Kiya Nahi
[C]Tujhse Raha Kyun Ju [D]Daa,        [Em]Mujh Pe Ye Zindagi
[D]Karti Rahi Sitam,        [C]Tune Hi Di Hai Pa [D]Naah
[Em]Tera [D]Mera [C]Rishta Pu [Em]Rana,        [Em]Hai Kya Ta [D]Dap,
Hai Ye [C]Kaisi Sa [Em]Zaa,        [Em]Tu Kyun Mu [D]Jhe
Aaj [C]Yaad Aa Ga [Em]Yaa,        [Em]Bechain Din Mere,
[D]Bechain Raat Hai,        [C]Kyaa Main Karu Kuchh Ba [D]Taa
[Em]Ye Mere Paav Hai,        [D]Khud Meri Bediyaan
[C]Mujhse Tu Mujhe Chhoo [D]Daa,        [Em]Tera [D]Mera [C]Rishta Pu [Em]Rana
[Em]Kyaa Mujh Mein [D]Hai Shaks,        [C]Wo Keh Ra [Em]Haa
[Em]Aa Ab Main [D]Du Karz,        [C]Tera Chu [Em]Kaa
[Em]Aankhen Hai Nam Meri,        [D]Saasein Chubhan Meri
[C]Zakhm Hua Pir Haa [D]Raa,        [Em]Dil Ke Viraane Mein,
[D]Mere fasane Mein,        [C]Tu Hi To Har Dum Ra [D]Haa
[Em]Tera [D]Mera [C]Rishta Pu [Em]Rana,        Oh [Em]Tera [D]Mera [C]Rishta Pu [Em]Rana
[Em]Tera [D]Mera [C]Rishta Pu [Em]Raana
